# RageClick-design Portfolio

Personal portfolio website for Ali Alizade, an Information Technology student.

## Built with

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

No frameworks or build tools are required.

## Pages

- `index.html` — introduction and profile
- `about.html` — background, qualifications, and activities
- `projects.html` — Logic Gates, Hour of Code, and Robotics projects

## Folder structure

```text
site-1101-portfolio/
├── index.html
├── about.html
├── projects.html
├── README.md
├── css/style.css
├── js/script.js
└── assets/images/
```

## Personalizing the project

1. Add your profile image as `assets/images/profile.jpg`.
2. Add project images to `assets/images/`.
3. Replace the marked placeholder descriptions in `projects.html`.
4. Update any personal details in `about.html`.
5. Commit the folder to a GitHub repository and enable GitHub Pages from the repository settings.

