## Interactive details

- Switch between dark and light themes; the preference is saved in the browser.
- Use the responsive navigation menu on smaller screens.
- Page sections animate into view when scrolling, with reduced-motion preferences respected.

## Running locally

Open `index.html` in a browser. The site does not require a server for basic use.
